@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed UML communication view — durable command / attempt collaboration
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

object "caller : Client" as C
object "handler : ResourceOwner" as H
object "store : OwnedPersistence" as DB
object "dispatcher : DurableDispatch" as D
object "worker : ScopedAdapter" as W
object "remote : ExternalFacility" as E
C --> H : 1: submit identified intent
H --> DB : 1.1: guarded state/result/pending commit
H --> C : 1.2: actual result / operation reference
D --> DB : 2: discover committed pending work
D --> W : 2.1: deliver eligible identity
W --> DB : 2.2: claim current generation / scope
W --> E : 2.3: admitted external attempt
W --> DB : 2.4: actual observation / uncertainty
legend bottom
 Numbered messages express ordering within one selected interaction, not call-stack nesting across processes.
 Validation, denied/conflict paths and lost-response alternatives are detailed in the sequence views.
 Links are communication paths; no shared mutable remote transaction is implied.
endlegend
@enduml
